<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Invariant Network — Curated Quant & ML</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0c;
      --card-bg: #141417;
      --text-main: #e4e4e7;
      --text-dim: #a1a1aa;
      --accent: #ffffff;
      --border: #27272a;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* Subtle background glow */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, #27272a 0%, #0a0a0c 80%);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 100px 24px;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 64px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .tagline {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      border-color: #3f3f46;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    ul { list-style: none; }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    li::before {
      content: "→";
      margin-right: 12px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      margin: 64px 0;
    }

    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card-bg) 0%, transparent 100%);
      padding: 48px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 32px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .button {
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button.primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #000;
    }

    .button.secondary {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .button:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 80px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Invariant Network</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Selective matching for high-stakes Quantitative Finance and Machine Learning roles.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Philosophy</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Depth over volume</li>
          <li>Manual screening only</li>
          <li>Zero recruiter spam</li>
          <li>Absolute privacy</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Network</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Tier-1 Quantitative Quants</li>
          <li>Applied ML Researchers</li>
          <li>Model Risk Specialists</li>
          <li>Domain-expert hiring teams</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-section">
      <h3>Inquiry & Access</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 8px;">Submissions are reviewed manually. Access is limited to maintain quality.</p>
      
      <div class="buttons">
        <a href="#" class="button primary">Candidate Screening</a>
        <a href="#" class="button secondary">Employer Intake</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      &copy; 2025 Invariant Network. Independent Initiative. No institution affiliation.
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
